          }
        ],
        "remediation": "Name the supplier of every component, the entity that creates, defines and identifies it (an NTIA minimum data field); placeholders such as NOASSERTION do not count. SPDX 2.x: set packages[].supplier (PackageSupplier), e.g. \"Organization: Example Ltd\", or packages[].originator (PackageOriginator); a NOASSERTION value is read as absent.",
        "help_uri": "https://www.ntia.gov/report/2021/minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
